# Acquired third-party data and source copies are intentionally NOT committed.
# Each is documented with a retrieval link in the nearest SOURCES.md; pull it
# from there. Rationale: do not bake a redistribution decision into this repo
# before licensing is checked. Webb's own copy is email-gated; the public
# mirror is EIG's redistribution decision, not one this repo inherits.

# Datasets acquired from third parties
/data/raw/*.xlsx
/data/raw/webb_exposure_by_occ1990dd_lswt2010.csv

# Paper archives (arXiv HTML/PDF)
/data/raw/gdpval_paper/

# Evidence copies saved during the feasibility check
/sources/webb-ai/*.pdf
/sources/webb-ai/*.html
/sources/webb-ai/*.csv

# Local tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
